exactly, and vk.com (biggest social network in europe) is a showcase. They use such framebreaker:<p><pre><code>   if (parent && parent != window && (browser.msie || browser.opera || browser.mozilla || browser.chrome || browser.safari || browser.iphone)) {
      document.getElementsByTagName('body')[0].innerHTML = '';
    }
</code></pre>
It cannot be bypassed with NoContent trick by the way. Because it removes body, not navigates the parent
